---
// Quorum playground: a DemoFrame around the QuorumDemo island, plus caption and styles.
import DemoFrame from './DemoFrame.astro';
import QuorumDemo from '../demos/QuorumDemo.tsx';
---
<figure class="qrm-figure">
  <DemoFrame title="Pick n, w and r, then break some replicas" titleVi="Chọn n, w, r rồi tắt bớt vài replica">
    <QuorumDemo client:visible />
  </DemoFrame>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>A simulation of one key. Every write goes to all replicas that are up, but only the first w to answer have the new version when the client hears OK; the rest count as slow. Who answers first is seeded random. Background anti-entropy is left out, so stale replicas stay stale until read repair or a later write reaches them. Dynamo's common setting was n = 3, w = 2, r = 2.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Đây là mô phỏng một khoá. Mỗi lần ghi gửi tới mọi replica đang chạy, nhưng chỉ w replica trả lời đầu tiên có bản mới lúc client nhận OK; số còn lại coi như chậm. Ai trả lời trước được chọn ngẫu nhiên có seed. Mô phỏng bỏ qua anti-entropy chạy nền, nên replica cũ cứ cũ cho tới khi read repair hoặc một lần ghi sau chạm tới nó. Cấu hình phổ biến của Dynamo là n = 3, w = 2, r = 2.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style is:global>
  .qrm-figure {
    margin: 2em 0;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .qrm-figure > .demo-frame {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  .qrm-figure > figcaption {
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.55;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .qrm .sd-stat span,
  .qrm .sd-group > span {
    text-transform: none;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .qrm .sd-group > span {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-style: italic;
    min-width: 1em;
  }
  .qrm .sd-stat b span {
    font-size: inherit;
    font-weight: inherit;
    color: inherit;
  }
  .qrm .sd-stat.is-bad b {
    color: var(--red);
  }
  .qrm .qrm-msg {
    min-height: 2.8em;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--text-body);
  }
  .qrm-scroll {
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  .qrm-svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 690px;
    min-width: 640px;
    height: auto;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .qrm-node {
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .qrm-node:focus {
    outline: none;
  }
  .qrm-node:focus-visible .qrm-disc {
    stroke-width: 3;
  }
  .qrm-disc {
    fill: var(--bg-alt);
    stroke: var(--text-muted);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }
  .qrm-disc.is-written {
    fill: var(--red-tint-bg);
    stroke: var(--red);
    stroke-width: 2;
  }
  .qrm-disc.is-down {
    fill: transparent;
    stroke: var(--text-faint);
    stroke-dasharray: 5 4;
  }
  .qrm-read-ring {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--text);
    stroke-width: 2;
  }
  .qrm-svg text {
    font-family: inherit;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .qrm-v {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--text);
  }
  .qrm-v.is-stale {
    fill: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .qrm-v.is-down {
    fill: var(--text-faint);
  }
  .qrm-small {
    font-size: 12px;
    fill: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .qrm-label {
    font-size: 14px;
    fill: var(--text-body);
  }
  .qrm .qrm-legend {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px 18px;
    justify-content: center;
    margin: 6px 0 0;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .qrm-key {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .qrm-swatch {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--text-muted);
    background: var(--bg-alt);
  }
  .qrm-swatch.is-written {
    border-color: var(--red);
    background: var(--red-tint-bg);
  }
  .qrm-swatch.is-read {
    border: 2px solid var(--text);
    background: transparent;
  }
  .qrm-swatch.is-down {
    border-style: dashed;
    border-color: var(--text-faint);
    background: transparent;
  }
</style>
